  data: {
    LLM: "Don't Bieten a category you can't win unless you're willing to bluff. With 3 cards, information is scarce.\n\nThe WELI allows creative bluffs. If you hold WELI + a middling card, you can Bieten for Best Heart claiming your WELI is the Ace of Hearts. Opponents don't know!\n\nMulti-Category Hands: A hand with a pair AND a high heart is extremely powerful. Bieten on multiple fronts forces opponents to spend concessions.",
